(CC-BY-4.0). You may share and adapt the artwork for any purpose, including
commercially, if you give credit, link to the licence and say whether you made
changes. Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The wordmark is set in Poppins, which stays under the SIL Open Font License
1.1 (`fonts/OFL.txt`) and is not relicensed here. The CC-BY-4.0 grant covers
the artwork as drawn, not the Poppins font software.

The artwork gives no right to use the TomTom name or marks. TomTom is a
trademark of its owner; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
TomTom.
